226	     * Handles {@link DisposableEmailException}, thrown when an owner's email uses a domain on the disposable-domain
227	     * blocklist ({@code mailinator.com}, {@code tempmail.com}, {@code guerrillamail.com}). Returns a
228	     * {@code 400 Bad Request} reporting the {@code email} field.
